From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:27:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0924/3799] soh: rename D_8087E410 -> sDLists

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: Gfx* table indexed by actor.params in BgHakaMeganeBG_Draw to pick the display list to draw opaquely.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_MeganeBG/z_bg_haka_meganebg.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_MeganeBG/z_bg_haka_meganebg.c         | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_MeganeBG/z_bg_haka_meganebg.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_MeganeBG/z_bg_haka_meganebg.c
index da6d439fc..9b344ffda 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_MeganeBG/z_bg_haka_meganebg.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_MeganeBG/z_bg_haka_meganebg.c
@@ -48,7 +48,8 @@ static u32 sUnusedColors[] = {  // was D_8087E3FC [LLM:HIGH]
     0x00000000, 0x00000000, 0x00000000, 0xC8C800FF, 0xFF0000FF,
 };
 
-static Gfx* D_8087E410[] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_8087E410: Gfx* table indexed by actor.params in BgHakaMeganeBG_Draw to pick the display list to draw opaquely.
+static Gfx* sDLists[] = {  // was D_8087E410 [LLM:HIGH]
     object_haka_objects_DL_008EB0,
     object_haka_objects_DL_00A1A0,
     object_haka_objects_DL_005000,
@@ -217,6 +218,6 @@ void BgHakaMeganeBG_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     if (params == 0) {
         Gfx_DrawDListXlu(play, object_haka_objects_DL_008EB0);
     } else {
-        Gfx_DrawDListOpa(play, D_8087E410[params]);
+        Gfx_DrawDListOpa(play, sDLists[params]);  // was D_8087E410 [LLM:HIGH]
     }
 }
